# kitty startup session. Linked to ~/.config/kitty/ by ./scripts/link-kitty and
# selected by `startup_session` in kitty.conf.
#
# This applies to the FIRST window of a kitty instance only: boss.py's
# _new_os_window builds its session without default_session, so cmd+n, new tabs
# and new windows still give a plain shell. `kitty <command>` also bypasses it.
launch zellij attach --create main
